# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# cfg-talespire-symbiote environment variables
#
# This symbiote ships only a manifest and icons — no build step, no runtime env
# vars. TaleSpire loads the UI straight from a remote URL.
#
# The Core URL is the `entryPoint` field in the manifest:
#   manifest.json      → https://core.crit-fumble.com/talespire/
#   manifest.dev.json  → http://localhost:3000/talespire/
#
# Choose one by which manifest you install (`npm run link` / `npm run link:dev`).
#
# This file exists so the contract is documented: there is nothing to set.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
